# hive-manager content gate — hashed denylist (safe to commit; contains no plaintext names).
# Entry = sha256(normalize(name)), normalize = lowercase, every run of non [a-z0-9] -> one space, trim.
# The gate hashes every 1..4-word n-gram of normalize(line) for each scanned line and fails on a match.
# Plaintext source is operator-private and never enters the repo or the hive.
